          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重做"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click on the disclosure indicator to choose a folder where PhotoTrail will place copies of images before performing any updates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击展开按钮，选择用于保存照片修改前副本的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoTrail will not place a copy of updated files in your selected backup folder if this box is checked. If there are issues while updates are in progress it is possible that image files could be corrupted. Allowing PhotoTrail to make a backup before updates occur is recommended.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选后将不再备份照片。如果保存时发生故障，照片可能受损，建议保留备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking this box will result in creation of a sidecar (XMP) file for updated image files if one does not exist. Updates are then written to the sidecar file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选后，为没有 XMP 附属文件的照片创建附属文件，并将修改写入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a format for latitude and longitude display.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择经纬度的显示格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select the color used to display GPS tracks on the map.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择地图中 GPS 轨迹的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select the width of line used to display GPS tracks on the map. Use 0 for the system default width.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择轨迹线宽，0 表示使用系统默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When matching image timestamps to a GPS track log PhotoTrail will assign locations to images taken this many minutes before and after the log endpoints. The first or last location will be used as appropriate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配照片和轨迹时，允许照片拍摄时间超出轨迹起止时间指定的分钟数，并使用对应端点的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this box is checked jpeg files that are part of a raw/jpeg pair can not not be updated. The jpeg image name is displayed in the table using a gray color.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选后，与 RAW 配对的 JPEG 文件不能编辑，文件名会显示为灰色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking this box will set file modification time to be the same as the image creation date/time whenever PhotoTrail updates image metadata with location changes. If the box is not checked file modification times will be controlled by the system.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选后，保存照片元数据时将文件修改时间设为拍摄时间；未勾选时由系统管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoTrail can set/update the GPS time and date stamps when updating locations. These timestamps are the same as the image create date and time but relative to GMP/UTC, not the local time. When setting this option it is important that the TimeZone (edit menu) is correct for the images being saved.  Please see the PhotoTrail help pages for more information on setting the time zone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新位置时，将 GPS 日期和时间设为拍摄时间对应的 UTC 时间。请先在“编辑”菜单中确认照片的拍摄时区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this option is enabled a finder tag will be added to updated images. The tag is alway added to the main image file even when a GPX sidecar file exists.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为修改后的照片添加访达标签。即使使用附属文件，标签也添加到照片主文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tag will be added to files when Tag updated files is checked. If the tag is empty \"PhotoTrail\" will be used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启文件标签后使用此名称，留空时使用“PhotoTrail”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If one image is selected it is set to this value. If multiple images are selected the difference between the original date/time and the updated value is applied to each image.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只选择一张照片时直接设置时间；选择多张时，将新旧时间的差值应用到每张照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latitude and Longitude updates will not take effect until the *return* key is pressed when either field is active.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改纬度或经度后，按回车键才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The above GPX file(s) have been processed and will show as tracks on the map.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上 GPX 文件已处理，可在苹果地图上显示轨迹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Either no tracks could be found or the GPX file was corrupted such that it could not be properly processed. Any track log information in the file has been ignored.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件没有轨迹，或已损坏而无法读取。该文件的轨迹信息未加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more files were not opened. Unopened files were duplicates of files previously opened for editing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些文件已经在编辑列表中，因此没有重复打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image backups are enabled but no backup folder is specified or the specified folder can no longer be found. Please open the program settings window (⌘ ,) and select a folder for image backups.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片备份已开启，但未指定备份文件夹，或原文件夹已不可用。请打开设置（⌘,）选择备份文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image updates are still being processed.  Please wait for the updates to complete before quitting PhotoTrail.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片仍在保存，请等待完成后再退出 PhotoTrail。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes to one or more images could not be sucessfully saved for unexpected reasons. The run log -- **Show log...** in the **Help** menu -- may contain more information.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分照片保存失败。可在“帮助”菜单中选择“查看日志”了解详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access to your Photos Library is now enabled. Click on the toolbar button or use Shift-⌘I to select images from the library.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已允许访问照片图库。点击工具栏按钮或按 Shift-⌘I 选择图库中的照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access to your Photos Library was denied. If you gave access to the program quit and re-launch PhotoTrail to make sure it is using the current state. If that does not resolve the issue open the Privacy and Security tab of System Settings and select Photos. Make sure PhotoTrail has full access.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未获得照片图库访问权限。如果刚刚授权，请退出并重新打开应用；仍不可用时，请在系统设置的“隐私与安全性”中检查照片访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
